{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17424","headline":"赠魏国宪穆公主挽歌词二首 二 · 权德舆","name":"赠魏国宪穆公主挽歌词二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦楼晓月残，卤簿列材官。\n红绶兰桂歇，粉田风露寒。\n凝笳悲驷马，清镜掩孤鸾。\n愍册徽音在，都人雪涕看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}